45
00:05:30,883 --> 00:05:32,200
My pen isn't working.

46
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,555
So the second one is--

47
00:05:36,510 --> 00:05:37,890
let's double check that I--

48
00:05:37,890 --> 00:05:39,670
I'll keep it back onto here,
in terms of the answers.

49
00:05:39,670 --> 00:05:41,670
I moved things around a
